 undesired results.  To prevent modification of the primary,
 secondary, or header information, payload integrity protection over
 at least the complete RTP packet is <bcp14>RECOMMENDED</bcp14>, for example using
-SRTP [9].</t>
+SRTP <xref target="ref-9" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="9"/>.</t>
